claim:
    ? forall u fn(t R) R,a,b R:
        fn(k R) R {a*(b*u(k))}=fn(j R) R {(a*b)*u(j)}
    by fn_extension:
        ? fn(k R) R {a*(b*u(k))}=fn(j R) R {(a*b)*u(j)}
        forall eval_index R:
            fn(k R) R {a*(b*u(k))}(eval_index)=a*(b*u(eval_index))=(a*b)*u(eval_index)=fn(j R) R {(a*b)*u(j)}(eval_index)
